    narr:narration """Tina Team's profile here splits into two dated movements. In the earlier meeting she frames [the four-site rollout, with one site nobody wants to touch](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_5), argues [why a double cutover is a different class of problem](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_15), and pins [a hard two-week number on the soak](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_17) grounded in [what the spring pilot's exception queue showed](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_19), defended as [evidence-first rather than speed-first](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_22). Around that spine runs a facilitator's register: [terse openers and closers](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_2), short acknowledgments ([\"That's the question.\"](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_7), [\"I'm with you on that.\"](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_9)), a blunt reality-check on [nobody deciding off stale counts](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_29), and [easy concession when a proposal lightens site-team load](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_41). The later meeting inverts the spine: she opens by [correcting herself at the top rather than burying it](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_1), [retracts the two-week soak outright](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3), explains [the re-analysis that found the old number was measuring a retired weekly job](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5) — [a job gone since July, so the figure was attached to the site as though it were a property of it](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_7) — and proposes [a one-week soak with the same margin she was originally arguing for](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9), while holding that [the sequencing itself doesn't move](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_11). She names the principle behind the correction as [defensible over conservatively-for-the-wrong-reason](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_14), counts [the three-week programme cost](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_17), notes [the flaw would have surfaced at the first site anyway, and worse](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_24), and commits to [writing it up the same day](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_22). A separate child records [a review acceptance act, relayed through Claude's report](narr:Expr_3ReviewEvents70102_2) — her signature on a decision, not her own voiced argument.""" ;
